d:["$","ul","9",{"className":"points","children":[["$","li","0",{"data-count":"","children":["Language. My parents helped me translate the bulletins and I checked every number against the Chinese, using DeepL for less important pages. I found no first-hand interviews with Heilongjiang corn farmers, so farmers’ views come from two surveys, one in Jilin."]}],["$","li","1",{"data-count":"","children":["Forecasts. The USDA forecasts in my progress report were wrong or have changed. ",["$","span","1",{"className":"cite","children":["",[["$","span","imports",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#imports","children":"IndexMundi (n.d.)"}]]}]],""]}]," still showed an old 13 million tonne forecast for 2024, so I used USDA’s later 1.8 million. The income figure in ",["$","span","3",{"className":"cite","children":["",[["$","span","huo",{"children":["",["$","$L2",null,{"href":"/references/#huo","children":"Huo et al. (2022)"}]]}]],""]}]," is older and much lower than USDA’s."]}],["$","li","2",{"data-count":"","children":["Phone check. Figure 3 was unreadable on my phone, so I split it into two panels with a narrow version."]}]]}]
